#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:4
msgid "Kanban"
msgstr "看板"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Kanban application in CryptPad is based on `JKanban "
"<https://www.riccardotartaglia.it/jkanban/>`__."
msgstr ""
"CryptPad 中的看板應用程式以 `JKanban <https://www.riccardotartaglia.it/"
"jkanban/>`__ 為基礎。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:13
msgid "Organisation"
msgstr "版面與操作"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:15
msgid "Move cards/columns:"
msgstr "移動卡片／欄位："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:17
msgid "``Drag`` the card/column to its desired position and ``Drop``."
msgstr "將卡片或欄位「拖曳」到目標位置後「放開」。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:19
msgid "Remove a card/column:"
msgstr "移除卡片或欄位："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:21
msgid "The |trash| area appears once you are dragging an element."
msgstr "當您拖曳某個項目時，畫面會出現 |trash| 區域。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:22
msgid ""
"``Drag`` the card/column to the |trash| Delete area at the bottom of the "
"screen and ``Drop`` the card/column."
msgstr "將卡片或欄位「拖曳」到畫面底部的 |trash| 刪除區域後「放開」。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:24
msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:26
msgid ""
"|pencil| button on the card/column to open the editor > **Delete** and "
"confirm."
msgstr "點選卡片或欄位上的 |pencil| 按鈕開啟編輯器 > **刪除** 並確認。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:29
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "欄位"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:31
msgid "Create a new column:"
msgstr "新增欄位："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:33
msgid "|plus| button to the right of the last columns."
msgstr "最後一個欄位右側的 |plus| 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:35
msgid "Change the title of a column:"
msgstr "變更欄位標題："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:37
msgid "``Click`` on the column title."
msgstr "點選欄位標題。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:38 ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:58
msgid "Type the new title."
msgstr "輸入新標題。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:39 ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:59
msgid ":kbd:`Enter`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Enter`"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:41
msgid "The column title and color can be changed in the column editor:"
msgstr "可在欄位編輯器中變更欄位標題與顏色："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:43
msgid "|pencil| button next to the column title."
msgstr "欄位標題旁的 |pencil| 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:44
msgid "Change the title and/or pick a color."
msgstr "變更標題及／或選擇顏色。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:45
msgid "**Close**, :kbd:`Esc` or :kbd:`Enter`"
msgstr "**關閉**、:kbd:`Esc` 或 :kbd:`Enter`"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:48
msgid "Cards"
msgstr "卡片"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:50
msgid "Create a new card with the buttons at the bottom of each column:"
msgstr "使用各欄位底部的按鈕新增卡片："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:52
msgid "|cptools add-bottom| to add a card at the bottom of the column."
msgstr "|cptools add-bottom|：在欄位底部新增卡片。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:53
msgid "|cptools add-top| to add a card at the top of the column."
msgstr "|cptools add-top|：在欄位頂端新增卡片。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:55
msgid "Change the title of a card:"
msgstr "變更卡片標題："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:57
msgid "``Click`` on the card title."
msgstr "點選卡片標題。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:61
msgid "The title of a card can also be modified in the card editor (see below)."
msgstr "卡片標題也可在卡片編輯器中修改（見下方）。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:64
msgid "Card editor"
msgstr "卡片編輯器"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:66
msgid "Open the card editor:"
msgstr "開啟卡片編輯器："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:68
msgid "|pencil| button next to the card title."
msgstr "卡片標題旁的 |pencil| 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:70
msgid "In the card editor:"
msgstr "在卡片編輯器中："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:72
msgid "Edit the card title."
msgstr "編輯卡片標題。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:73
msgid ""
"Edit the card body using `Markdown <https://github.com/adam-p/markdown-"
"here/wiki/Markdown-Cheatsheet>`__: Italics, bold, links, lists, todo-"
"lists, etc. are supported."
msgstr ""
"使用 `Markdown <https://github.com/adam-p/markdown-here/wiki/Markdown-"
"Cheatsheet>`__ 編輯卡片內文：支援斜體、粗體、連結、清單、待辦清單等。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:76
msgid ""
"Insert images with the |picture-o| menu in the markdown toolbar (Markdown"
" syntax for remote images is blocked, see :ref:`remote_content`)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Markdown 工具列中的 |picture-o| 選單插入圖片（遠端圖片的 Markdown 語法已"
"停用，請參閱 :ref:`remote_content`）。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:77
msgid "Pick a card color."
msgstr "選擇卡片顏色。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:78
msgid "Add or remove tags to the card."
msgstr "為卡片新增或移除標籤。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:79
msgid "Delete the card."
msgstr "刪除卡片。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:82
msgid "Display"
msgstr "顯示方式"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:84
msgid "Use the |minus| and |bars| icons at the top right to display:"
msgstr "使用右上角的 |minus| 與 |bars| 圖示切換顯示："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:86
msgid "|minus| only card titles."
msgstr "|minus|：僅顯示卡片標題。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:87
msgid "|bars| full card contents."
msgstr "|bars|：顯示完整卡片內容。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:89
msgid "The tags at the top of the board are used to filter cards:"
msgstr "看板頂端的標籤可用來篩選卡片："

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:91
msgid "``Click`` on one or more tags."
msgstr "點選一個或多個標籤。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:92
msgid "Only cards with these tags are displayed."
msgstr "僅會顯示具有這些標籤的卡片。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:93
msgid "Any new cards will automatically receive the selected tags."
msgstr "新建立的卡片會自動套用目前選取的標籤。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:94
msgid ""
"``Click`` on a selected tag to de-select it, or use |times| **Clear "
"filter** (at the left of the list) to de-select all tags."
msgstr ""
"點選已選取的標籤可取消選取，或使用清單左側的 |times| **清除篩選** 取消所有標"
"籤選取。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:98
msgid "Import/Export"
msgstr "匯入/匯出"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:100
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |upload| **Import**"
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |upload| **匯入**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:101
msgid "Supported formats: ``.json`` files exported by this application."
msgstr "支援格式：由此應用程式匯出的 ``.json`` 檔案。"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:103
msgid "|file-o| **Files** > |download| **Export**"
msgstr "|file-o| **檔案** > |download| **匯出**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/kanban.rst:104
msgid "Supported formats: ``.json``."
msgstr "支援格式：``.json``。"

#~ msgid "``Enter``"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "**Close**, ``Esc`` or ``Enter``"
#~ msgstr ""
